#decision("Safety and security rules live in code, not only in the prompt")[
*Options:* instruct the model to be safe, or enforce safety in code. *Choice:* code: prompt injection ranks first in the OWASP Top 10 for LLM applications \[74\] and injected text can steer a model \[75\], so notes, complaints and photo text are data, the model's tools act only on the session, and attestations come only from the technician's own plain statements. *Consequence:* warnings, refusals and locks behave the same in every mode.
]

